(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #159: a width beside a precision of 0 counts no decimal
 point, because none is printed, so every line is twelve characters wide in
 every sink.)

a number called n is 63.
Print "[{n:012.0}]".
Print "[{n:12.0}]".
Print "[{n:012.1}]".
Print "[{n:012}]".
a float called f is 63.0.
Print "[{f:012.0}]".
Print "[{f:12.0}]".

a text called padded is "[{n:012.0}] [{n:12.0}]".
Print padded.
a buffer called line is "[{n:012.0}]".
append " [{n:12.0}]" to line.
Print line.

a list called sizes is [63, "sixty-three"].
Print "[{element 1 of sizes:012.0}]".
a value called size is 63.
Print "[{size:12.0}]".

To 'show the size' with a number called count.
    Print "[{count:012.0}]".
    a text called shown is "[{count:12.0}]".
    Print shown.

'show the size' with 63.
